# Packages an earlier Nova depended on and this one does not, one a line.
# nova update removes one once the release that stopped needing it is
# installed, and only where it is there for Nova's sake alone: pacman has it
# as a dependency, and nothing installed needs it (nova-update-apply,
# drop_retired). One you installed by name stays.
ttfx    # played the screensaver's effects; Nova plays its own (src/screensaver)
ggml    # came with Arch's whisper.cpp; Nova's whisper-cpp carries its own copy
udiskie # mounted removable drives; nova-sessiond does, through udisks2 (src/session)
system-config-printer # waited all day for printing; Settings' Printers page and nova-sessiond do (src/session, nova-printers)
bluez-tools # bt-agent answered pairings; nova-sessiond's Bluetooth agent asks on Nova's card (src/session)
zenity      # bt-agent's questions; Nova's card asks them
openssl     # AirDrop's TLS; AirDrop left Nova (curl, which the Calendar's sync uses, still brings it)
zlib        # AirDrop's unpacking; AirDrop left Nova
bubblewrap  # AirDrop's sandbox for an offer's picture; AirDrop left Nova (Flatpak and the Image Viewer still bring it)
